    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pokémon battles are nuanced. You can’t expect to\nwin just by using strong moves all the time!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Spreading that message is why I battle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007000720065006100640069006E0067002000740068006100740020006D00650073007300610067006500200069007300200077006800790020004900200062006100740074006C0065002E001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you really want to become stronger, then let me\nteach you about barriers—moves that reduce the<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ndamage your Pokémon take.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 131
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Talk to me if you want to battle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540061006C006B00200074006F0020006D006500200069006600200079006F0075002000770061006E007400200074006F00200062006100740074006C0065002E001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll show you what barriers can do. Are you ready\nto face me?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000730068006F007700200079006F007500200077006800610074002000620061007200720069006500720073002000630061006E00200064006F002E002000410072006500200079006F0075002000720065006100640079000A0074006F002000660061006300650020006D0065003F001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m ready!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200072006500610064007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Not yet",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F007400200079006500740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I get why you’re dragging your feet. Nobody likes\nlosing, I guess.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020006700650074002000770068007900200079006F00752019007200650020006400720061006700670069006E006700200079006F0075007200200066006500650074002E0020004E006F0062006F006400790020006C0069006B00650073000A006C006F00730069006E0067002C00200049002000670075006500730073002E001000020114013A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Pokémon use moves that reduce the incoming\ndamage from opponents’ attacks.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSome of us call these moves “barriers”!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’re way stronger than I expected! I don’t think\nyou need me to teach you about barriers...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Still, a promise is a promise. Let me explain the\nmoves my Pokémon used.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The move Reflect reduces the damage the user’s\nteam takes from physical moves for a while.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Light Screen is similar, but it reduces the damage\ntaken from special moves instead.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ll have a lot more opportunities in battle if\nyour Pokémon are taking less damage.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I gotta admit, it feels kinda embarrassing to\nlecture someone who beat me.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI’m sure you’ll have no problem combining moves\nto get all sorts of effects.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕĺ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
